  "prefLabel": "Ed 318.03 Eligibility",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 318.03 Eligibility. Persons or entities eligible to apply to establish a charter school shall be organized as a nonprofit corporation in accordance with the provisions of RSA 292. Such corporation shall first establish a prospective board of trustees and prescribe the board's duties in a set of proposed bylaws which shall be consistent with the prospective board duties under RSA 194-B:5.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for Ed 318) #10873, eff 7-1-15; ss by #13253, eff 8-18-21",
